  "label": "Racial Binary Framework",
  "description": "The meme operates within a racial binary framework that pits Blackness against Whiteness, suggesting that one group is inherently 'good' or 'safe' while the other is 'bad' or 'dangerous'. This binary thinking is a core component of systemic racism and is used to justify discrimination and violence against Black people.",
